  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Regnb&#xe5;ge Projekt 2017-2020</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Rainbow Project 2017-2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention aims to mainstream LGBTI rights in Turkey by way of:i. capacity development of professionals and LGBTI organizations working on LGBTI issues;ii. enhancing the visibility of LGBTI issues on mainstream media by way of training journalists, producing responsible news and analyzing media trends on the issue andiii. awareness raising of key stakeholders and responsible institutions through networking opportunities, enriching the literature and human rights reporting on the topic as well as lobbying activities</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">KAOS GL (h&#xe4;r efter KAOS) har ans&#xf6;kt om st&#xf6;d fr&#xe5;n Sida f&#xf6;r att genomf&#xf6;ra projektet &#x201d;The Rainbow Project 2017-2020&#x201d; om 13 852 422 SEK.   

Insatsen syftar till att minska diskriminering gentemot HBTQ-personer i det turkiska samh&#xe4;llet genom en rad aktiviteter s&#xe5; som att; f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndra allm&#xe4;nhetens perception av HBTQ-personer genom ansvarstagande medial rapportering; p&#xe5;verka offentlig och privat sektor i sitt f&#xf6;rh&#xe5;llningss&#xe4;tt vis-a-vis anst&#xe4;llda HBTQ-personer; &#xf6;ka kapaciteteten f&#xf6;r de icke-statliga organisationer som arbetar f&#xf6;r HBTQ-r&#xe4;ttigheter samt f&#xf6;r de individer som i sin profession bist&#xe5;r HBTQ-personer (t.ex. advokater, socialarbetare och psykologer); bedriva p&#xe5;verkansarbete gentemot beslutsfattare p&#xe5; nationell och internationell niv&#xe5; f&#xf6;r HBTQ-medveten lagstiftning; f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad &#xf6;vervakning av brott mot m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter f&#xf6;r HBTQ-personer; samt bist&#xe5; HBTQ-personer med samtalsst&#xf6;d.

Utvecklingsinsatsens totala budget &#xe4;r 13 852 422 SEK och finansieras i sin helhet av Sida. 2 252 521 SEK av insatsens budget &#xe4;r avsatta f&#xf6;r vidaref&#xf6;rmedling till KAOS implementerande partner i projektet, organisationen Black Pink Triangel (BPT).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention will try to address wide-spread discrimination against LGBTI individuals in Turkish society through various channels involving changing public perceptions by way of responsible reporting in mainstream media, influencing public and private sector in their practices vis-a-vis LGBTI employees, increasing the capacities of NGOs working for the rights of LGBTIs as well as professionals who give services to LGBTI individuals (lawyers, social workers, pyschiatric personnel), lobbying for LGBTI sensitive legislation vis-a-vis decision makers at national and international level, better monitoring of human rights violations of LGBTI individuals and providing consultancy for LGBTI individuals.</narrative>
  </description>
